# GPT Live (client delegation)

Session: `model: gpt-live-1`, `delegation: { type: "client" }`.
Cannot switch to Responses mid-session.

```ts
// On data channel:
// session.input_transcript.delta  → keep in the app
// session.delegation.created      → POST /api/delegate { delegation_id, transcripts }
// then session.thinking.append / session.commentary.append (≤500 tokens)
```

Camera never reaches Live. Browser `getUserMedia({ audio: true })` is the default path.
Glasses ingest is additive (`noteGlassesSeen`); if silent, `health.input === "browser"`.

Exa: `timeout` + skip. Do not `await` enrichment before appending to Live.
P0 is **bank + research**, not face recall. Delegate on spoken name and new facts.
Hermes `send` only if `HERMES_ENABLED=1` *and* hall is already up; else local Exa.
Quota fail: OpenRouter then Oxen (`https://hub.oxen.ai/api/ai`).
